  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two spherical balls having equal masses with radius of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> each are thrown upwards along the same vertical direction at an interval of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> with the same initial velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then these balls collide at a height of _____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>,</p><p>(take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>150</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>height</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><m